So we've said basically where buyers and sellers have agreed to 70%

494
00:30:40,988 --> 00:30:44,917
of the day's volume, that will be the value error for the day.

495
00:30:46,164 --> 00:30:48,364
So you can see the first major difference.

496
00:30:48,464 --> 00:30:56,264
Now, again, note in this instance, the point of control, obviously, we would have that in a traditional value error.

497
00:30:56,964 --> 00:31:00,164
a volume base value will have a volume point of control.

498
00:31:00,464 --> 00:31:02,264
In this example, they are the same.

