point of control on the right also happens to be the price where the most volume was traded.

503
00:31:15,864 --> 00:31:19,071
It's very unusual to see them both at the same

504
00:31:19,071 --> 00:31:23,561
price. It does occur, but it's more likely that they occur at different prices.

505
00:31:23,764 --> 00:31:28,264
So again, you need to decide from this day forward what would you prefer to use.

506
00:31:28,464 --> 00:31:34,364
I recommend using the volume point of control constantly so that I have a constant benchmark to lean against.

507
00:31:35,664 --> 00:31:38,164
The next thing is obviously the balance of distribution.

508
00:31:38,464 --> 00:31:43,764
As we can see, the distribution looks very similar.

